{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_skgoat_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_skgoat_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"遠方遺物","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_skgoat_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"db537465ad8b830a575e39dc63fd96d66fbe41668cf5dbc3db825f1dfc6ab31b","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"多次收到巴赫曼教授的女兒發來的信件後，地靈終於還是決定用掉幾天寶貴的年假前去赴約，怕麻煩的她卻也因此捲入麻煩之中。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g2_slumstreets"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真冷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你現在敲門，我們就不用站得更久。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我和她不太熟，有點不好意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多年過去了，你還是那麼怕生，真讓我欣慰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多年過去了，你我反而成了同事，更叫人感到神奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，算了，作為你的同事，還是幫你這個忙吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊塔尼亞女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"巴赫曼小姐，這位就是你寫信邀請過的地靈，格拉西艾爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？我在整理老媽的遺物時發現了一個裡面寫著“給格拉西艾爾”的盒子，所以一直邀請你過來取走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隔了這麼久，你終於來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回家探親的時候順路，就來一下，看看巴赫曼教授到底要給我什麼東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"進來吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盒子上的鎖已經被我們撬開了。本來我們也不知道這是什麼，撬開後讀了裡面的信才發現是給你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過具體裡面裝的是什麼，到現在我也不是很能看明白。還請賜教。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"是什麼？一張紙和一塊石頭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"好傢伙，大老遠跑一趟就是為了一張紙和一塊石頭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是一張施術單元抑制器的圖紙，只寫了一些技術理論，還遠遠沒有完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"學會她教我的源石技藝後，我能聽到一些礦物的振動；成了感染者後，卻只有一片雜訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，在羅德島治療，病情穩定後，雜訊就消失了，我又變得可以聽見，甚至能聽得“更清晰”了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但當時，我們兩個都手足無措。她認為是礦石病增大了我施術的輸出功率。因此，她說要在我工作滿一年時，做一個管用的抑制器給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"施術單元？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在萊塔尼亞，定製個施術單元相關的東西還不簡單？我老媽還得自己研究嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果只是一味“抑制”，原本很輕的聲音，就會變得完全聽不見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以需要一個熟悉該源石技藝，又瞭解礦物振動頻率的人，手動調整不同波長的抑制方式。就好像給琴調音一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來很厲害嘛，可惜沒有完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我現在仍然需要這樣的抑制器......既然巴赫曼教授已經走到這一步了，也許我可以拿回去繼續研究。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另一個呢，那個石頭是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是信標石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請解釋一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"某些岩石非常容易與源石發生變質作用，從而形成含有一定源石的變質岩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們會對我的源石技藝產生強烈的反應。在音叉的協助下，我可以在較遠的距離感應到它們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巴赫曼教授會把反應最強烈的幾種作為信標石，用來標記地點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本，每次和她出去，我們口袋裡都會帶一些，走一會放置一塊，用來防止我們迷路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那假如別人也用這種方法走過相同的路，你們的信標石不就混起來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目前會使用這種方法的人並不多，我們又各自持有不同頻率回音的信標石，不僅不會弄混，甚至可以知道誰來過這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來是一種十分方便的源石技藝啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本質就是讓物體輕微振動而已。精確控制源石技藝的輸出頻率是小頭，對礦物成分的瞭解程度才是這個源石技藝的重點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她給你留這個是為了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許是一個線索，告訴我可以在這座城市用源石技藝按這個信標石頻率搜索一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"派克......這種程度的源石技藝應該沒關係吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"不會影響公共安全，也不會引起路人注目的話，應該沒事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有，一條不太明顯的線索，一直通向城外的方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去看看嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然呢？你明天可要走了，還來得及嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來不及也沒辦法，反正知道了，下次再說也行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，巴赫曼教授一直教導我，“好奇心即是毀滅的開端”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又不是不知道這是移動城市呀，如果是在城外的話，下次來說不定就找不到了哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是來放假的，不是來工作的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼能算是工作呢。找到的東西，不就歸你了嗎？多走幾步路，多賺一點錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"地靈，其實可以去。我剛才聯繫過酒店了，說房間還沒準備好，起碼得再等兩個小時。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，這是什麼辦事效率......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，那我們現在就出發，希望天黑以前，可以結束。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"城外居然還有這樣的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你確定東西就在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，信號一直通向這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......一個洞廳，遠處有一條橫巷。洞壁支撐架已經被落石覆蓋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼？難道這個礦洞就是我老媽留給你的東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個礦洞看起來在很早以前就已經被過度開採過了。而且，我也沒聽說過教授還擁有私人礦洞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前方還有信號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"東西就在塌方處下面埋著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下面？早知道就該帶上工具來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，交給我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"地靈將音叉法杖立於地面，伴隨著似有似無的奇怪聲響，塌方處開始變得像液體一般。\n接著，又如同沸騰了，開始劇烈翻滾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不一會，一個表面有著複雜花飾的鐵質箱子，竟被翻了上來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來是個裝著貴重物品的箱子啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看來東西不便宜啊，真是一個好消息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你們要做什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你通知我。這樣一來，那個巴赫曼教授的所有遺產我都可以拿到手了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巴赫曼小姐？！這是你設下的陷阱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉啦。我是很想早點收手，可是我的丈夫非要把所有的東西都理清楚再離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"親愛的，我們把東西賣掉，就可以離開了吧？就像你之前說的那樣，我們可以去哥倫比亞過上好日子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖！能不能射準點？還是說你們想先讓她雙腿殘疾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你幹什麼？你瘋了嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不知道我從多久以前就開始計畫這件事，中間又花去了多少精力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果，巴赫曼除了一個房子，一大堆無用的石頭外，根本沒留下多少東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天終於把剩餘的最後一樣東西弄到手了，我也就不需要你了。多一個人分，我可要少分到一半呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有了這筆錢，我在哥倫比亞的礦業生意一定能東山再起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧瞧這，移動城市外的廢棄礦洞，千載難逢的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"住手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格拉西艾爾，尊敬的格拉西艾爾女士。聽說雷姆必拓的幾家公司已經給你發出了邀請，你都一一回絕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你願意加入我，我可以放你一條生路，讓你成為我的得力手下，甚至可以給你當個小主管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在並沒有在尋找新的工作。雖然到手薪資不多，羅德島的各種福利補貼對我這樣的感染者來說還是很誘人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你難道不想，偶爾逃出名為生活的牢籠？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一次假期，但不用被既定的返工時間打擾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一段日子，僅僅是躺在被窩裡什麼也不去想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不想擁有這樣的生活嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰會不想要這樣的生活呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就加入我，我給你很長的假期，很大的權力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你當時也是這麼對巴赫曼小姐說的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不得不承認，你的話對一些年輕人來說確實很有吸引力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過上了那麼長時間的班後，我已經知道了，這樣的工作根本就不存在。條件開得太好的工作，多半都是騙人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我給你開的條件裡，還包括了你的生命。你不該和我作對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在羅德島要時刻注意上司的狀態已經夠麻煩了，現在我是請了年假的，在這期間，至少有些事情我還是想自己做主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好疼......嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叫什麼叫！真煩人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們幾個，先把她給我殺了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"還是放箭嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蠢貨！就你這個準頭，別折磨她了！讓她死得乾脆點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"上，直接用刀吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！我怎麼走不動——有東西在抓著我的腳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"不！是你在下沉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此路不通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"救命！到我的胸口了！我快沒法呼吸了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"拉住我的手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"我們過不去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格拉西艾爾，我可以把這當成是你對我提議的最終回應嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我改變主意了。直接把這三個人都殺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！我還什麼都沒——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"全部換弩箭。就在這個距離解決他們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵B","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"先瞄準那個施法的卡普里尼！殺了她，讓這個法術停下來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"別想傷到我的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶，差點忘了還有一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵A","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，這地方太狹窄了。對面立個盾，就可以把箭全擋下。因為那個卡普里尼的源石技藝，我們也沒法過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......真麻煩......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我請你來不是為了讓你站在這裡抓耳撓腮的！給我想想辦法！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇傭兵隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，那來嘗嘗這個！剛才在洞口找到的炸藥！只要綁在弩箭上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"沒用的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？瞄準的是我們頭上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們會因年久失修的礦洞坍塌而意外死亡！完美的結局！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"小心——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"巴赫曼小姐抬起頭，只看到了巨大的黑影。\n一塊車輪大小的石塊率先朝著她所在的地方落了下來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她還沒來得及理清當前的狀態，一隻白皙的手，出現在了她的上方。\n當石塊接觸到那隻手掌，便化成了細細的沙塵。如同瀑布一樣，從那隻手的指間流下，落到她的面頰上，還帶著手掌的餘溫。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"narration","text":"不苟言笑的卡普里尼正一手輕輕扶著她的肩，另一隻手高高舉起。\n如此近的距離下，她似乎嗅到了和自己母親一樣的氣息——那種泥土與青草的芳香。\n消失近二十年的安全感包圍了她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝......你的源石技藝，竟然可以做到這種事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一點計算而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了。這次我沒有遲到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"這次是更深處的地方！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了，這裡要塌了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"他們是想把我們全活埋嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"派克，躲到我身邊來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得我們應該先跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巴赫曼小姐走不動！而且路口已經被那幾個人擋住了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們也不能就在這裡什麼也不做吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！地靈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你的監測環，警示燈變紅了！停下！這會出事的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，只是一些誤報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼......骸骨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別去看，會嚇著你的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"靠緊了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，都去死吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"起初，那些石塊化成了不同色彩的沙粒紛紛落下，如飄落的繁星。\n漸漸地，沙粒變得越來越粗，如春雨般淅淅瀝瀝地叩響沉悶的土地。\n隨後，遠處的石塊開始落下，重重地砸在地上。\n腳下被“流沙化”影響的地面，並沒有吞沒其中的人，反而如升漲的潮水般，將三人溫柔托起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"地靈？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事，只是在調整！捂住口鼻！別讓這些沙塵進入你的體內，不然到時候解除源石技藝後你們得去看醫生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是在分析每一塊落石與每一寸地面的成分並用不同的頻率使它們振動？這可不是什麼“一點計算”了啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦出了一點錯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搞......搞什麼......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但她現在無法動彈！射箭！齊射！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"未必。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那些在面前紛落的沙塵，突然又恢復到了原來落石的樣貌。在下落的過程中，擋住了遠處射來的所有箭矢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"隨後，巨盾一般的石塊落在了地上，卻如落入湖水般，引起一道巨大且單向擴散的漣漪，又翻湧成浪濤，徑直向站在礦洞口的人奔去。\n在觸碰到他們雙腳的瞬間，湖面般的地面又一次恢復了原狀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼——完全動不了了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"派克，把他們的手綁起來，然後喊警察來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！你以為她就那麼清白嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偽造遺囑，搶奪財產，在場的所有人，只有她全程參與了我的計畫，是我的同夥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"利用你來找出最後的遺產，也是她給我出的主意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偽造遺囑，搶奪財產？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巴赫曼小姐，你為什麼要這樣做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒發現嗎？我老媽一點也不愛我。同樣是她生的，我哥小時候就經常有她陪著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我呢？我什麼也沒有......至少財產多給我一點，也是理所當然的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在說什麼傻話！你知道你在做什麼嗎？！包括剛才，也是和這個人合謀想利用我對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我老媽照顧了你那麼多，你幫我暫時擺脫一下糟糕的生活又怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本來又沒打算要你的命......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你瞧，我才剛畢業，在這之前，我只能到處找工作。但是有了這筆錢，我就可以不用幹活，天天想睡多久都行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嬌生慣養。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你懂什麼？你每年不也只回家一次？像你們這種只知道工作的大人真的在乎家庭？你們這些人也只配在無聊的生活循環中溺死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒法評價，也不會去維護巴赫曼教授在你眼中扮演的角色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你沒有資格這麼說我，你更沒有資格評判任何一個努力工作努力活著的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，我是一個幾乎沒時間回家的混帳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我除了在羅德島上班外，如果真的有時間，還會做一些天災信使的活來賺錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道我是為了什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道我做這些，是為了能夠忙到沒時間回家一趟？你以為我們都願意這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的家在移動城市外，只是在一個貧窮又落後的小鎮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的故鄉就在那裡，它不會移動。當附近有移動城市的時候，那很好。但是移動城市終有一天會離開，它不會帶上我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我沒辦法賺到足夠的錢讓我家人搬進移動城市裡，那天災來了怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我雖然是一個天災信使，但我除了努力工作賺錢外，想不到任何其他更長久有效的辦法來解決這個跟天災相關的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許你認為自己可以不像我們大多數人一樣，對待生活無可奈何。如果你不關心問題本身，那也別有這麼幼稚的優越感！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少這些遺產是我靠努力得來的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是我在這裡，你也未必能得到什麼。你的那個萊納德在做這種事上都比你要努力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫路易士——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你給我閉嘴！我根本不在乎你這種人叫什麼名字！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"平日安靜的卡普里尼發出一聲怒吼。\n崩塌的礦洞卻無法反射出一句回聲。\n就連剛才環伺身邊的骸骨生物，也低吟著退開了一段距離。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......遵命。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巴赫曼小姐，據我所知，你的母親，很愛你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明正是因為寵愛你，想給你更好的生活，她才一個人打了四份工。大學教授，地質專家，天災信使，鋼琴家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的哥哥小時候飯都吃不飽，落下了很多毛病。巴赫曼教授很害怕你也像你哥哥一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她給了你優渥的生活，給了你萊塔尼亞最好的教育，卻也導致了你如今的......不成熟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這有什麼？說給了我那麼多東西，可她連家都不怎麼回。就算工作再忙，也可以請假吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實......巴赫曼教授後來有一次是請了假想回去找你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在那個時候，因為我在一次野外調查時，在一個洞穴內腳一滑摔了下去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師說我那時的樣子十分慘烈，還被裸露的源石劃了好多道傷口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"簡單處理後，她開著摩托把我緊急送到了羅德島。所以......都是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果她那時回來，你又把自己的想法告訴她，說不定她就會更早退休，就不會遇到那樣的事情了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一切也都怪我。是我那時的好奇心，導致了一切的發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巴赫曼教授教訓的是，“好奇心即是毀滅的開端”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你如果知道錯了，那就別再管我的事了，好嗎？就讓我好好生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我讓警察把這個人抓走，他就會供出你。你的意思是要我也放過他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他身上有一些前科，當時是我找人用特殊手段把他帶進來的。只要把他偽造的證件銷毀掉，他就進不了城，也不敢進城了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如此看來，就是最好的辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你！你這個心狠手辣的女人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是你先背叛我的嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路易士","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是我現在動不了，我一定要把你殺了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你們現在是要我做決定嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你都說過抱歉了對吧？別讓我再失去正常的生活了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是很抱歉......巴赫曼小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做決定......那是領導才該幹的事情。我只想普普通通地工作，領一份我應得的收入。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"況且這是你們的家事，反而我才是那個被莫名其妙捲進來的人。打擾了我的假期，你會給我發加班薪資嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？！你這骯髒又該死的感染者——!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會帶你去醫院處理傷口，然後通知你的哥哥。看他對這樣的結果同意不同意。如果他同意，你就可以保持現狀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他不同意，那就交給法院判決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是在害我！你會毀了我的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許你已經毀了你自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"派克，我們分頭行動，效率高點。完事後在巴赫曼家門口見吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴赫曼小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g2_slumstreets"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊的事情都辦完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦，沒想到格拉西艾爾女士也有失控的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，我控制得很好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是釋放情緒。這也是放假的意義之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你在看什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巴赫曼的宅邸，我上次來時，庭院的花草修剪得當，屋外牆壁也十分乾淨，才過去幾年，竟然已經如此破敗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教授拼命賺錢養家，最終卻得到了相反的結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"作為主心骨，更是要多陪陪家人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"地靈，現在你得解釋一下監測環的事情。像剛才那種情況，我應該立刻向本艦彙報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛才看到我身後的東西了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"只能模模糊糊看見一點輪廓，那也是生物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。不是每個人都能看到，但我施放源石技藝的時候，會更顯眼一點。像剛才那種狀態，應該還是很容易看到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我的源石技藝本身要精準控制輸出功率，大部分振動所需的能量都是極小的，所以剩餘的能量就完全沒有用處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每次使用，都只取一點，剩下的就會像散熱一樣排出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道什麼時候，我身邊就吸引來了這樣的生物，會吞吃被浪費掉的能量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在羅德島的法術大師們的幫助下，我終於發現了調用儲藏在它體內能量的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過這種方法，會讓能量直接回流過我的身體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是監測環警示燈亮起的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以不用太擔心啦。但監測環的資料要處理一下，不然博士和凱爾希醫生嘮叨起來，到時候各種檢查，上不了班，拿不到薪資可就糟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你一直都不怎麼擅長說謊，我相信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，派克。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"哎？這麼說你的探親之旅還真兇險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對啊，累得很。我只是想順路見見巴赫曼教授的女兒，沒想到是在自找麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"你別老吃油炸的東西啊，來，我把菜分你一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偶爾吃一點，可以讓我感到快樂。吃薯條嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來你的心情真的很差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"別把自己逼得太緊，而且食堂的薯條放太久都軟掉了，真不知道你怎麼下得去嘴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，箱子裡是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"箱子裡是一些採自烏薩斯以北地區的地質單元。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，看起來你可又有的忙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會。巴赫曼教授告訴過我，這些都來自尚待探索的土地，不過我們也許一生都無法探究它們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她說她終有一天會把這些東西交給我保管。沒想到，她早就已經做好了準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"壓抑住好奇心對你們這樣的研究者來說是不是還挺難的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我還有很多愛好。我下班後可以做我感興趣的其他事情，而不用一直在思考還有什麼東西需要我來解決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，這也是我和教授約定好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要做的就是找凱爾希醫生和博士上報，然後把它們好好保存起來，僅此而已。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我剛才想起來，這件事我還沒有上報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地靈","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——看來又會是一個難熬的午後。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_145_prove","aliases":["普羅旺斯"]}]}
